        "No personal AI/PAT approval/payment/period-close capability is added by this schema.",
        "Company lock first; then tenant/project/period/source/role/policy/version/idempotency rechecked.",
        "On absent dry_run server selects true before hashing; explicit false still requires ordinary service authorization.",
        "Same idempotency key+normalized input returns original; changed input conflicts. Business source consumption is a separate unique constraint.",
        "PROPOSED cascade extension, not current support: atomically append InvoiceReversal signed header and exact inverse snapshots of ALL effective lines/allocations. No partial reversal.",
        "Each reverse snapshot references original line/allocation/source. Unique company/original invoice and original allocation prevents double reversal with changed key.",
        "Never overwrite historical amounts/status; effective reversed state is projected, aggregate version alone advances. Header-only reversal has empty child arrays.",
        "All children, header, audit, event, capacity release commit or roll back together. Same-key retry returns exact original result/event IDs; changed-key reversed invoice conflicts.",
        "Current open period only, reversal_date<=today; omitted occurred_on defaults reversal_date, omitted posting_period defaults its month; supplied values must match. Do not reopen original locked period. Release source capacities exactly once.",
        "Emit invoicing.reversed.v1 once transactionally; existing invoice.reverse result remains invoice_reversal refs with new event ID. No ledger/cost/income/obligation/cash posting.",
        "Original invoice SourceRef.version is lock-checked; optional expected_version must agree. Existing optional envelope fields remain optional."
