  "owner": {
    "bridge": "invoicing sole allocation/coverage/reversal writer; settlement/costing supply authoritative eligibility/capacity.",
    "implementation_owner": "WP-INVOICE integrator"
  },
  "service_rules": [
    "Server derives tenant/actor/role/project/plugin context; owner or finance only. Closed schemas reject client organization/role/actor/status/balance. No PAT/AI writes.",
    "Sources must already be approved/posted by another authorized approver: approved BankCharge (fee_bearer=company), posted ExpenseClaim, or eligible active/posted Settlement with approved upstream provenance. Allocation never approves a source; reject pending/self-approved provenance.",
    "PG company lock first, then invoice and source locks in namespace/kind/id order; recheck auth/period/policy/versions/capacity. Facts, audit, outbox, idempotency result and version increment commit atomically.",
    "expected_version = invoice_ref.version = live invoice version; source versions match live. Invoice active, same tenant/CNY, project visible, not reversed. line_no unique. Match supplier/customer through authoritative economic origin as specified below, not employee payee or net-receipt customer.",
    "One call creates COMPLETE lines plus allocations of header-only invoice; no partial/incremental edits. Unique company/invoice/line_no and company/line/source independent of idempotency key.",
    "Each header/line/allocation gross=net+tax; componentwise sum(lines)=header and sum(allocations)=line. Nonnegative integers, gross>0, component/header totals <=10^12. Decimal ROUND_HALF_UP, no float. Verify supplied tax against evidence.",
    "Sales source only settlement.settlement receivable; purchase source settlement.settlement payable, costing.expense_claim or costing.bank_charge. Existing same-tenant/project/CNY eligible source, not reversed/cancelled. No arbitrary/manual/invoice/accounting source or manufactured obligation; BankCharge is a dependency on core-extension.plan.json, not an assertion canonical already supports it.",
    "For selected source AND normalized origin, ALL effective allocations <= authoritative invoiceable gross/net/tax individually. Use FACE tax, not recoverable tax or deductibility. Missing/null face tax is unknown, never zero. No cost/income/obligation/cash posting.",
    "occurred_on <= server today; posting_period matches month and is open; invoice_date <= occurred_on. Reject locked period, unauthorized project, disabled dependency or stale version.",
    "Same company/contract/key + normalized input returns exact stored result/event IDs before stale-version rejection; changed input conflicts. Exclude request_id; default dry_run=true before hashing. Dry-run persists no idempotency/refs/events/version/capacity.",
    "Changed key cannot reuse invoice/line/source; company lock, DB natural-key uniqueness and cross-invoice capacity recheck prevent double consume. Retry appends no facts/audit/outbox.",
    "Purchase supplier: for employee reimbursement Settlement.payee.kind=employee, follow actual Settlement.source_ref to ExpenseClaim.counterparty_id. Employee is claimant/payee, never invoice supplier. Missing expense.counterparty_id => missing_evidence and refuse formal allocation until approved correction. Do not fabricate Supplier=Employee.",
    "BankCharge.counterparty_id is bank/fee invoice supplier, never customer of original net receipt. Resolve and compare that supplier with purchase invoice.counterparty_id; if null require missing_evidence correction first. If aliased to expense/legacy origin, supplier and scope evidence must agree across chain, otherwise reject.",
    "Sales AR still matches authorized receivable customer and invoice.counterparty_id; new purchase paths cannot relax sales customer/project/direction checks.",
    "ExpenseClaim.tax_cents and BankCharge.tax_cents mean face tax. For confirmed face gross G and tax T, require 0<=T<=G and use invoiceable [G,G-T,T]. CostEvent.recoverable_tax_cents and deduction eligibility do not cap invoice tax and do not define invoice net.",
    "Unknown/null/absent face tax permits recording invoice header evidence via existing invoicing.invoice.record/v1 but NOT invoicing.lines.allocate/v1; this command remains atomic complete allocation, so it cannot save unallocated lines. Complete approved expense/BankCharge evidence correction first; never auto-deduct tax, mutate historical cost or convert unknown to zero. No standalone unallocated-line write capability is claimed."
  ],
